# Embedded repo - add as submodule if needed
latest-glowup-channel/

.md
# Only pnpm-lock.yaml is the source of truth here; npm leaves a rival lockfile
# behind if anyone runs `npm install`, and the two disagreeing is what breaks
# installs (pnpm refuses to reuse a tree it thinks npm owns).
package-lock.json
